{"game": "gunfire-reborn", "language": "english", "appid": 1217060, "month": "2021-11", "window": 4, "start_date": 1637625600, "end_date": 1638316799, "month_true_total": 4274, "quota": 28, "returned": 28, "pulled_at": "2026-09-27 01:49:23 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "104911163", "author": {"steamid": "76561198031645156", "personaname": "Gunpowderman", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198031645156/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 2024, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2024, "last_played": 1631327132, "avatar": "cb7e5523b3250907ed6be9c5f337214baca5705a"}, "language": "english", "review": "Interesting", "timestamp_created": 1638316783, "timestamp_updated": 1638316783, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "104909957", "author": {"steamid": "76561198004056634", "personaname": "LVT", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/lvtheosis/", "num_games_owned": 415, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 10259, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5934, "last_played": 1755545150, "avatar": "9142f10face82b1fa32b88da4ac70aa6dcf25fc0"}, "language": "english", "review": "The game has a great variety of heroes (playable characters), weapons, scrolls (passive abilities) and enemies. \nYou can play solo or co-op up to 4 people, also you can all pick the same hero if you want to. Sadly, there isn't a reconnect option if someone temporarily disconnects from the session.\nAs you progress in the game and unlock more powerful assets that help you complete your runs successfully, you also unlock more challenging difficulty options, which greatly extend the game's longevity.\n\nDefinitely one of the better games in its price pool. Solid roguelite experience. \n", "timestamp_created": 1638315999, "timestamp_updated": 1638315999, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.542986392974853516", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 17, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 11, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 13, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "104909318", "author": {"steamid": "76561198075242970", "personaname": "Renegator", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/HedaRenegade/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 5586, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4509, "last_played": 1786672431, "avatar": "21228275b3080fbd08eb7de40fa8ef7ad3098425"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great game that will reward you with great scrolls and weapons, gain your confidence, and when you least expect it punish you for greedy movement. 10/10 will get frustrated again but continue playing", "timestamp_created": 1638315572, "timestamp_updated": 1638315572, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.49751242995262146", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "104908532", "author": {"steamid": "76561199130226358", "personaname": "WeToddHead", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199130226358/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 2200, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1187, "last_played": 1695601570, "avatar": "d2e23816a57166086421bfaddc346e47f93364a6"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is an excellent game with friends. The element damage is a really nice touch.  I also love how the characters have different stats and abilities.  Some of the weapons also have abilities which makes the element change or change the type of shot. overall with game is totally worth it!", "timestamp_created": 1638315058, "timestamp_updated": 1638315058, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.49751242995262146", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 2, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "104907771", "author": {"steamid": "76561198965580845", "personaname": "Vorteiss ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198965580845/", "num_games_owned": 15, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 2954, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2713, "last_played": 1761904161, "avatar": "a7a2fa3c43e831c176262f826a890d38e3897671"}, "language": "english", "review": "dad", "timestamp_created": 1638314573, "timestamp_updated": 1638314573, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.414593666791915894", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "104907545", "author": {"steamid": "76561198346376076", "personaname": "Wisdom Foxtail", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198346376076/", "num_games_owned": 22, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 28729, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3554, "last_played": 1786566760, "avatar": "22dfc5559fc6a4563a733b253bebb5363135954c"}, "language": "english", "review": "Very replayable. Each game is a bit different than the last. Great game to relax to and enjoy a few quick kills and some dungon crawling as well.", "timestamp_created": 1638314413, "timestamp_updated": 1638314413, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.525078356266021729", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "104907271", "author": {"steamid": "76561198080826763", "personaname": "Rodge", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198080826763/", "num_games_owned": 172, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 1558, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1185, "last_played": 1682682239, "avatar": "34568ea409a116be5311e51a8c78c17d93dcbf38"}, "language": "english", "review": "gud game I likey", "timestamp_created": 1638314237, "timestamp_updated": 1638314237, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.49751242995262146", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "104907228", "author": {"steamid": "76561198017835312", "personaname": "Flock Spy Camera", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/wifienyabledcat/", "num_games_owned": 365, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 4651, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4346, "last_played": 1668813300, "avatar": "fa8a4de374f1e716b6a7607fd74319fd0cdf936e"}, "language": "english", "review": "shoot guys", "timestamp_created": 1638314213, "timestamp_updated": 1638314213, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.49751242995262146", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "104907208", "author": {"steamid": "76561197970263391", "personaname": "Bilbo Begins", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/illoso/", "num_games_owned": 1254, "num_reviews": 82, "playtime_forever": 3447, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2189, "last_played": 1728772090, "avatar": "fc3eb62aa4e68eac6b3e5e8fed1e68ecfe1901f8"}, "language": "english", "review": "You can play as a dog that pukes 32 grenades per second out of his mouth like a cupid statue spitting water. \n\nAlso Gunfire Reborn has some of the most fun weapon designs I'm aware of in a shooter.\n\nDeafening Mortar has two fire modes. The first shoots three gigantic cluster bombs in a short-range shotgun-style spread, and the other launches three cluster bombs out of the mortar. It looks like fireworks, if fireworks were made out of void energy, and it causes so many damage numbers to pop up that it always feels good to fire.\n\nIcy Spear is a throwing spear that's not content stopping there - when you throw it, wherever it hits it creates an icy vortex that does continual AoE damage, and the secondary fire gathers all of those vortexes in the distance in front of you then draws them back to you, hitting any enemies along the way for a guaranteed crit. You throw out an array of aoe zones and then channel them into one huge multi-hit against your intended target.\n\nIt has a gun that can do the thing from Fifth Element where you shoot a tracer round and then all followup shots are smart rounds that home in on it. It has dragon familiars that float around your arm and breathe fire in place of flamethrowers. It has a sniper rifle that shoots a drill which bores into the enemy and does continual true damage to them. There's an assault rifle that charges up cluster-rockets that it can fire when scoring headshots, magic talismans that home in on enemies and you can choose what element they're attuned to with each throw, throwing knives that ricochet endlessly through rooms, pistols that shoot grenades and pistols that shoot spread-fire like shotguns, a shotgun that can charge up to become a sniper shotgun, a gun that shoots black holes, tony stark laserhands, and even a katana and claymore that do interesting things.\n\n", "timestamp_created": 1638314195, "timestamp_updated": 1638314501, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.49751242995262146", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "104907144", "author": {"steamid": "76561198010965566", "personaname": "^porp", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/porpetavoraz/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 34, "playtime_forever": 9637, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 471, "last_played": 1705282798, "avatar": "ba129ee08cc8bf2952cf9f1db917bc658ea6958f"}, "language": "english", "review": "Very good, surprised me in a positive way. Great to play with friends. \n\nIt's a mix of Risk of Rain with Borderlands, great artstyle even though it's not the best and soundtrack is fine. Enemies are varied enough and might oneshot you sometimes. I just wish it had Workshop or mods but it seems that due to design decisions that would never be possible.", "timestamp_created": 1638314141, "timestamp_updated": 1638314141, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.49751242995262146", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "104907108", "author": {"steamid": "76561198111056077", "personaname": "Blits", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Blits07/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 64, "playtime_forever": 9467, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4476, "last_played": 1771650789, "avatar": "f3d05db4d8557efbcdbfb337f4176abe9fcb5c1b"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is everything you love about Borderlands in Roguelite form. The characters are unique, the weapons are amazing, and you can make your build broken in different ways every run. To top it all off, the Co-op is even better!\n\nIf you enjoy loot-shooters or roguelites, this is a must try! If you like both of them (as I do) it's easy game of the year material.", "timestamp_created": 1638314118, "timestamp_updated": 1638316143, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.5", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "104906926", "author": {"steamid": "76561198043714763", "personaname": "Puffin", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/PuffinThePangin/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 1265, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 286, "last_played": 1772950113, "avatar": "905e79443be93e55772b518e8f81fde1d9b3fcb0"}, "language": "english", "review": "I'm not super well-tuned in the world of Multiplayer Roguelite games but this one really felt like it hit all the checkmarks for me! Love the process of building your character differently every time, making almost everything viable, and just generally being fun all around while doing so!", "timestamp_created": 1638313983, "timestamp_updated": 1638313983, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "104905660", "author": {"steamid": "76561198308403592", "personaname": "Warghost", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198308403592/", "num_games_owned": 470, "num_reviews": 21, "playtime_forever": 7101, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4322, "last_played": 1723156226, "avatar": "b065052744c2fee95b33ca27ba0885336c4bd8e6"}, "language": "english", "review": "Got to be one of my favorite roguelites. Each character has their own strength and weaknesses, and how they play a part in co-op. Boss fights are fun. The daily challenges are no joke sometimes, they can be difficult.", "timestamp_created": 1638313087, "timestamp_updated": 1638501038, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "104905653", "author": {"steamid": "76561197993388860", "personaname": "Galandil", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197993388860/", "num_games_owned": 314, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 26292, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 12465, "last_played": 1759377884, "avatar": "691e6f59f9889bb4f18c50a4cb6400d3b360d9be"}, "language": "english", "review": "One of the best, if not *THE* best, FPS roguelite on the market.\n\nNothing more, nothing less.", "timestamp_created": 1638313080, "timestamp_updated": 1638313080, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0